the journey of do I belong here.

00:23:20.208 --> 00:23:21.927
Am I supposed to be here?

00:23:21.927 --> 00:23:24.162
And then you get the confidence back and
such.

00:23:24.162 --> 00:23:27.812
So I think the idea of where I
would be in five years changed so

00:23:27.812 --> 00:23:29.426
much throughout the GSB.

00:23:29.426 --> 00:23:32.576
But I think ultimately,
I'm still chasing my north star,

00:23:32.576 --> 00:23:35.602
which is what is the ultimate,
what was most important.

00:23:35.602 --> 00:23:39.362
And I think, really, when I look back
to the answering the question of

00:23:39.362 --> 00:23:43.399
