00:27:16.748 --> 00:27:18.309
&gt;&gt; Awesome, thank you.

00:27:18.309 --> 00:27:20.190
I'm Hral, why don't you answer that next?

00:27:21.690 --> 00:27:26.649
&gt;&gt; Yeah, so I think for me, I didn't know
