00:27:50.136 --> 00:27:55.440
So I chose more of a path of
elimination to figure things out.

00:27:55.440 --> 00:27:59.055
But one of the things were
just really helped and,

00:27:59.055 --> 00:28:03.619
I think accelerated a little bit
