00:29:04.761 --> 00:29:09.253
the network for sure, but also just
the confidence in built in to go ask for

00:29:09.253 --> 00:29:09.850
things.

00:29:11.300 --> 00:29:12.340
&gt;&gt; Awesome, thanks.

