to put a five year plan out there.

00:29:48.970 --> 00:29:52.088
I did certainly do that,

00:29:52.088 --> 00:29:57.141
[LAUGH] because just
kept some general goals.

00:29:57.141 --> 00:30:01.867
And I don't know,
I think have worked out in a way that I'm

00:30:01.867 --> 00:30:06.690
